Depends: openmediavault (>= 8.0), openmediavault-compose (>= 8.2.0), rsync
Priority: optional
Description: openmediavault Nextcloud plugin
 Manage the Nextcloud file sync and share server (self-hosted
 collaboration platform) from the OpenMediaVault web interface. The
 Docker Compose stack (nextcloud, db and redis) is registered in the
 openmediavault-compose plugin on save and rendered by it, so it
 follows the Compose plugin conventions and can be inspected, edited
 and started on the Compose page; the plugin provides start/stop/
 restart/update buttons, reports the live container status, the
 running Nextcloud version and available upstream updates. Includes
 Chinese translations.
